whisper: Lesson 4: Doing things again
whisper:
whisper: Computers are great at boring jobs. "repeat 3 times:" does its lines three times.
whisper: "for each n from 1 to 5:" does them once per number, and n is that number each time round.
whisper:
whisper: Press F6 (Watch) instead of F5 this time. It runs one line at a time and shows you
whisper: what each name holds as it goes. Handy when something does what you didn't expect.
whisper:
whisper: Your turn: print the 9 times table, from 1 times 9 up to 12 times 9.

genesis:
  repeat 3 times:
    scrawl "Hip hip hooray!"
  for each n from 1 to 5:
    scrawl n, " times 7 is ", n times 7
and the universe said i love you
